{
    "title": "Hearts: Card Game",
    "description": "Hearts is a classic competitive card game and MobilityWare\u2019s artificial intelligence in this free Hearts card game ensures YOUR play has the ultimate competitive edge in this trickster cards game!\r\n\r\nHearts may call to mind card games like Spades, Cribbage, Euchre, and Pinochle - but if you don\u2019t play those trickster cards games, don\u2019t worry - this free sequence game will teach you how to play with our intuitive AI. Plus, our artificial intelligence adapts to your Hearts card gameplay style. Play feels fair, even though your artificial intelligence Heart game opponents are some smart bots. But while playing them can feel like the ultimate challenge, MobilityWare\u2019s Hearts free hints AI feature is at your disposal and the smartest of them all!  AI bot opponents offer another major benefit - you can play them offline, so no Wi-Fi is required to play this classic card game!\r\n\r\nEver play a Heart game with real online users and experience inconveniences? Never worry about other users taking too long or abandoning a game in this free card games classic. Enjoy the adaptability of AI, and benefit from MobilityWare\u2019s free Hearts hints system, which always puts you in a clear position to win the Hearts game you play! Plus - this free Hearts game is loaded with artificial intelligence and we guarantee you\u2019ll notice your sense of relaxation and fun in this sequence game. Enjoy playing sequence games like Spades, Cribbage, Euchre, and Pinochle? Then download Hearts now!\r\n\r\nGet Excited for Features!\r\nWhether you\u2019re going to Shoot the Moon as a Hearts card master or new to Hearts, you\u2019ll find our ultimate classic card game has a setting for your comfort and challenge level as a sequence game player. Enjoy gameplay similar to classic card games like Spades, Cribbage, Euchre and Pinochle!\r\n\r\nArtificial Intelligence \r\n- We cannot stop talking about this classic card game\u2019s adaptive and fair AI features! \r\n- Playing Hearts free is a cinch with smart opponents\r\n- And our even more intelligent free Hints feature\r\n\r\nPlay Offline, Anytime\r\n- Wifi? Who needs it?\r\n- No need to wait around for real users to log on with this free Heart game\r\n- And no need to have game delays when their internet lags\r\n- Reliable AI bots want to play cards with you all day, no internet required\r\n- Perfect for players who enjoy free card games and trickster cards games like Spades, Cribbage, Euchre, and Pinochle!\r\n\r\nFair Play\r\n- Learn to play a classic card game with our simple start guide and free automated advice (which you can turn off!)\r\n- Use as many free Hints as you like, powered by the smartest AI in our app!\r\n- Use the free Undo function as many times as you like if you need to rethink your moves in this ultimate sequence game\r\n\r\nSome Tips for Hearts Beginners!\r\n- Scoring points in Hearts free is not a good thing (unless you collect ALL available points) in this trickster cards game\r\n- Each hearts suit card is worth 1 point\r\n- Beware the Queen of Spades - a card worth 13 points!\r\n- If you collect all points available in the game, they get thrown to your opponents in a dramatic feat called Shooting the Moon!\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on this ultimate free classic card game and download the best Hearts game available for your mobile device now! If you\u2019re a fan of trickster cards games like Spades, Cribbage, Euchre, and Pinochle, you\u2019ll be sure to enjoy our Hearts game!\r\n \r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com\r\n \r\nFor answers to frequently asked questions, head over to:\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com/support.php",
